fragment_downloaded_cb({"url":"codecparsers/gsth264parser.html#gst_h264_parse_sps","fragment":"\n\tgst_h264_parse_sps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.prototype.h264_parse_sps\n\n\n\tGstCodecParsers.h264_parse_sps\n\nParses data, and fills the sps structure.\nParameters:\nThe GST_H264_NAL_SPS GstH264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstH264SPS to fill.\na GstH264ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the sps structure.\nParameters:\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264SPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\nParses data, and fills the sps structure.\nParameters:\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnitType.SPS GstCodecParsers.H264NalUnit to parse\nThe GstCodecParsers.H264SPS to fill.\na GstCodecParsers.H264ParserResult\n"});